#>wonder_agents_plans_appositioncachegranules_w_1
?["On a real edit sequence, what share of edited lines sit inside an apposition envelope rather than outside any?"]{
  #:depth #!computational // lens: invalidation proportionality
  $^["open"]@here => %[edit.lines_in_apposition, edit.lines_total]
  ~#hypothesis: "most edits fall outside appositions, so per-granule invalidation would rarely beat whole-file"
  !probe{ "for the last 50 commits touching .spw surfaces, take each hunk's changed line ranges and test them against the spans from scanAppositions on the post-commit text; report the in-envelope share per file and overall." }
  $%[apposition.coverage, edit.in_envelope_share]
}
